sequenceDiagram
    actor NOC as NOC
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant BE as Backend
    participant DB as Database
    participant TG as Telegram API

    Note over NOC,TG: HKN-018 & HKN-019: Analisis Diff dan Restore Backup

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note right of NOC: HKN-018: Analisis Diff Perubahan
        NOC->>FE: Pilih 2 versi konfigurasi<br/>dari history
        activate FE
        FE->>BE: GET /api/versions/diff?v1={id}&v2={id}
        activate BE
        BE->>DB: Query backup records<br/>(config_text versi 1 & 2)
        activate DB
        DB-->>BE: Return kedua konfigurasi
        deactivate DB
        BE->>BE: Generate diff (Python difflib)<br/>Line-by-line comparison
        Note over BE: Diff Engine module
        FE-->>NOC: Tampilkan diff viewer:<br/>+ Added lines (hijau)<br/>- Removed lines (merah)<br/>~ Modified lines
        deactivate BE
        deactivate FE
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note right of NOC: HKN-019: Restore Backup dari Telegram
        NOC->>FE: Cari file backup<br/>(filter: tanggal, perangkat)
        activate FE
        FE->>BE: GET /api/backups/search?filters={...}
        activate BE
        BE->>TG: Query list file di channel
        activate TG
        TG-->>BE: Return list backup files
        deactivate TG
        FE-->>NOC: Tampilkan list backup tersedia
        deactivate BE
        deactivate FE
        
        NOC->>FE: Pilih file untuk restore
        activate FE
        FE->>BE: POST /api/backups/restore/{file_id}
        activate BE
        BE->>TG: Download file dari channel
        activate TG
        TG-->>BE: Return file content
        deactivate TG
        
        alt File Compressed (gzip)
            BE->>BE: Decompress file
        end
        
        BE->>BE: Simpan ke local storage (./backups)
        Note over BE: Filesystem operation
        FE-->>NOC: File restore berhasil<br/>(path: /restore/...)
        deactivate BE
        deactivate FE
    end
